Class <<temporal.businesstemporal>> {meta::pure::profiles::doc.doc = 'A night watch kept over one lighthouse lamp, effective over business time so a re-entered watch supersedes its earlier record while the night it was logged for stays put.'} test::gildedlighthouse2::domain::LampWatch
{
